# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw dataset protection — CURRENT data lake (verified local layout: datasets/)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ignore all DATA payloads under datasets/ by file type so no match ball-by-ball
# files, archives, or proprietary dumps can enter Git:
datasets/**/*.json
datasets/**/*.yaml
datasets/**/*.yml
datasets/**/*.csv
datasets/**/*.parquet
datasets/**/*.zip
datasets/**/*.tar
datasets/**/*.tar.gz
datasets/**/*.7z
datasets/**/*.gz

# Attribution / source-notice / documentation files are intentionally NOT
# ignored, so each dataset's LICENSE.txt, README.txt (CricSheet source notices)
# and any .md can still be tracked for provenance and licence compliance:
#   (datasets/**/LICENSE.txt, datasets/**/README.txt, datasets/*.md remain
#    trackable by default)

# Legacy path (pre-2026-11 CricSheet/ archive) — keep protection in case it
# reappears: ignore its payloads the same way.
CricSheet/**/*.json
CricSheet/**/*.yaml
CricSheet/**/*.yml
CricSheet/**/*.csv
CricSheet/**/*.parquet
CricSheet/**/*.zip
CricSheet/**/*.tar
CricSheet/**/*.tar.gz
CricSheet/**/*.7z
CricSheet/**/*.gz

# Any future raw data landing zones.
raw_data/
staging/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large raw archives and proprietary hackathon data must never enter Git
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.7z
# The proprietary hackathon dataset (introduced by the competition) — ignore the
# whole directory wherever it lands; track ONLY a deliberate licence/notice stub
# under docs/ if one is needed.
hackathon_dataset/
hackathon_dataset/**

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local environments, tooling artifacts, scratch
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.env
.streamlit/secrets.toml
node_modules/
.mermaid-cache/
*.log
